<title>EGYPT: Cairo Housing end-Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Cairo Housing end-Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available).</p>
<p>Net sales			    24,203,000</p>
<p>Operating costs		     9,974,000</p>
<p>Overheads			     3,541,000</p>
<p>Exceptional revenue		   546,000</p>
<p>Net profit before tax	    11,234,000</p>
<p>Full company name is Cairo Housing and Development.</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
